 "outcomeNote": "a list of amoraic rulings extending the twelve-month rule",
 "continuesQuestionOf": null,
 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "avodah_zarah.34a.7",
   "daf": "34a",
   "sentenceId": 6,
   "he": "אִתְּמַר, אָמַר רַבָּה בַּר בַּר חָנָה אָמַר רַבִּי יוֹחָנָן: כְּשֶׁהֵן אֲסוּרִין — אֲסוּרִין אֲפִילּוּ בַּהֲנָאָה, כְּשֶׁהֵן מוּתָּרִין — מוּתָּרִין אֲפִילּוּ בַּאֲכִילָה.",
   "en": "«It was stated» that «Rabba bar bar Ḥana says» that «Rabbi Yoḥanan says: When» these grape residues «are prohibited,» one is «prohibited even from» deriving «benefit» from them. «When they are permitted, they are permitted even with regard to consumption.»"
  },
  {
   "id": "avodah_zarah.34a.8",
   "daf": "34a",
   "sentenceId": 7,
   "he": "אָמַר רַב זְבִיד: הַאי דּוּרְדְּיָּא דְּחַמְרָא דַּאֲרַמָּאֵי, בָּתַר תְּרֵיסַר יַרְחֵי שַׁתָּא שָׁרֵי. אָמַר רַב חֲבִיבָא בְּרֵיהּ דְּרָבָא: הָנֵי גּוּלְפֵי, בָּתַר תְּרֵיסַר יַרְחֵי שַׁתָּא שָׁרֵי. אָמַר רַב חֲבִיבָא: הָנֵי",
   "en": "«Rav Zevid says:» With regard to «these yeasts» produced from «the wine of Arameans, after twelve months» of «the year they are permitted. Rav Ḥaviva, son of Rava, says:» With regard to «these jugs» that belong to gentiles, «after twelve months» of «the year they are permitted. Rav Ḥaviva says:» With regard to «these»"
  },
  {
   "id": "avodah_zarah.34b.1",
   "daf": "34b",
   "sentenceId": 0,
   "he": "אֲבַטָּא דְּטַיָּיעֵי, בָּתַר תְּרֵיסַר יַרְחֵי שַׁתָּא שְׁרֵי. אָמַר רַב אַחָא בְּרֵיהּ דְּרַב אִיקָא: הָנֵי פּוּרְצָנֵי דַּאֲרַמָּאֵי, בָּתַר תְּרֵיסַר יַרְחֵי שַׁתָּא שָׁרֵי. אָמַר רַב אַחָא בְּרֵיהּ דְּרָבָא: הָנֵי גּוּלְפֵי שְׁחִימֵי וְאוּכָּמֵי, בָּתַר תְּרֵיסַר יַרְחֵי שַׁתָּא שְׁרֵי.",
   "en": "«canteens» belonging «to Arabs, after twelve months» of «the year they are permitted. Rav Aḥa, son of Rav Ika, says:» With regard to «these Aramean grape pits, after twelve months» of «the year they are permitted. Rav Aḥa, son of Rava, says:» With regard to «these brown and black jugs, after twelve months» of «the year they are permitted.»"
  }
 ],
